1
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:11,790
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We have to reach
the oasis sometime today,</b></font>

2
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:13,250
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>or else our provisions
will be in trouble!</b></font>

3
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:16,500
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We have water that I extracted out
of that giant scorpion,</b></font>

4
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:18,080
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>so we can still get by!</b></font>

5
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:21,790
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Well, I refuse to "get by"
with scorpion water</b></font>

6
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:24,040
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>for the rest of the Chunin Exam!</b></font>

7
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:28,790
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's just like you planned.</b></font>

8
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:31,580
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I didn't account for this.</b></font>

9
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,170
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You are...</b></font>

10
00:02:10,010 --> 00:02:13,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>The Yamanaka Clan:</i>
<i>Secret Ninjutsu</i>

</b></font>

11
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You are...</b></font>

12
00:02:29,930 --> 00:02:31,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Please hand over your scroll.</b></font>

13
00:02:31,930 --> 00:02:35,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Then we will allow you access to
the water in the oasis up ahead.</b></font>

14
00:02:35,430 --> 00:02:37,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And if you wish, medical treatment.</b></font>

15
00:02:37,930 --> 00:02:40,300
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What?!
We don't need to be treated by you!</b></font>

16
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We have our own medical specialist!</b></font>

17
00:02:44,550 --> 00:02:45,050
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ino…</b></font>

18
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:46,130
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

19
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:50,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Besides, no one told us the oasis's
water belonged to anyone.</b></font>

20
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:52,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You tell 'em Choji!</b></font>

21
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:54,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sakura, you tell 'em too!</b></font>

22
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We don't need treatment,
but we definitely need water.</b></font>

23
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:01,220
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hey, we'll lose even before we fight,
if you get weak like that!</b></font>

24
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:01,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ino!</b></font>

25
00:03:06,090 --> 00:03:08,090
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sand Formation: Shisa!</b></font>

26
00:03:14,130 --> 00:03:14,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ino!</b></font>

27
00:03:16,050 --> 00:03:16,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Are you all right?</b></font>

28
00:03:19,180 --> 00:03:20,300
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So she was a pawn?</b></font>

29
00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:25,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Jumping within my range of attack
without taking any precautions…</b></font>

30
00:03:27,090 --> 00:03:30,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I heard this team had two Medical Ninja
and was curious…</b></font>

31
00:03:31,970 --> 00:03:34,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But she doesn't have
the cool-headed judgment</b></font>

32
00:03:34,550 --> 00:03:36,470
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>required of a Medical Ninja.</b></font>

33
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:39,300
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How disappointing that
my expectations were unwarranted.</b></font>

34
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:44,090
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Which means… No more negotiating.</b></font>

35
00:03:44,550 --> 00:03:45,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Seems that way.</b></font>

36
00:03:46,340 --> 00:03:47,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You just fired us up!</b></font>

37
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:50,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Choji and I will break through this!</b></font>

38
00:03:55,930 --> 00:03:57,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Medical Water Style!</i>
<i>Water Praying Mantis!</i></b></font>

39
00:04:09,010 --> 00:04:10,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Don't worry.</b></font>

40
00:04:10,930 --> 00:04:14,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Once we get your scroll,
I'll treat your wound.</b></font>

41
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:18,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>It's not an ordinary Water Style blade.</i></b></font>

42
00:04:19,470 --> 00:04:21,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>It's as sharp as a Chakra Scalpel.</i></b></font>

43
00:04:23,930 --> 00:04:25,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>She's very strong!</i></b></font>

44
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Saganken: Sand Stone Fist!</i></b></font>

45
00:04:36,930 --> 00:04:38,220
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Damn! I missed!</b></font>

46
00:04:40,260 --> 00:04:42,090
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Partial Expansion Jutsu!</b></font>

47
00:04:47,260 --> 00:04:51,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>This sand fist…is equal to</i>
<i>my size and power…</i></b></font>

48
00:04:51,970 --> 00:04:52,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>But…</i></b></font>

49
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>…it's ridiculously hard.</i></b></font>

50
00:05:01,590 --> 00:05:04,300
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>And it must be pretty heavy…</i></b></font>

51
00:05:04,970 --> 00:05:06,340
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>But he easily…</i></b></font>

52
00:05:09,970 --> 00:05:12,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Let's see who's stronger!</b></font>

53
00:05:20,590 --> 00:05:23,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Amazing… To see through</i>
<i>successive attacks…</i></b></font>

54
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:28,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Damn it…</b></font>

55
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:46,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Your attack is boring!</b></font>

56
00:05:51,630 --> 00:05:54,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He just took a blind swing!</b></font>

57
00:05:57,300 --> 00:05:58,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You seem to be having a hard time.</b></font>

58
00:05:59,180 --> 00:06:00,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Not as hard as you.</b></font>

59
00:06:01,260 --> 00:06:03,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You two…
are fooling around too much.</b></font>

60
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Did you finish infusing chakra?</b></font>

61
00:06:06,930 --> 00:06:07,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Here I go!</b></font>

62
00:06:08,090 --> 00:06:09,720
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Polarized Sand Formation.</b></font>

63
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:12,300
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Burning Sand Camouflage!</b></font>

64
00:06:21,010 --> 00:06:22,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>They disappeared!</b></font>

65
00:06:26,130 --> 00:06:26,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Choji!</b></font>

66
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:37,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This is not the time…</b></font>

67
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:39,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>to worry about the others.</b></font>

68
00:06:52,090 --> 00:06:55,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Now, how will you fight
a foe you can't see?</b></font>

69
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:56,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Choji…</b></font>

70
00:06:57,340 --> 00:06:59,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If we scatter,
we'll be at a disadvantage.</b></font>

71
00:07:00,550 --> 00:07:01,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You got my back?</b></font>

72
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:02,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>U-Uh-huh!</b></font>

73
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:14,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sakura… Choji…</b></font>

74
00:07:31,430 --> 00:07:33,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>At 8 o'clock, distance 10…</b></font>

75
00:07:34,260 --> 00:07:37,510
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>At 3 o'clock, distance 5…
Two of them.</b></font>

76
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:40,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>At 6 o'clock, distance 30.</b></font>

77
00:07:56,930 --> 00:07:58,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>It's no good!</i>
<i>My chakra's disrupted…</i></b></font>

78
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:00,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I can't tell!</i></b></font>

79
00:08:07,090 --> 00:08:09,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>If my concentration</i>
<i>lapses even a little,</i></b></font>

80
00:08:09,090 --> 00:08:10,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>my Sensory Perception</i>
<i>doesn't work.</i></b></font>

81
00:08:12,130 --> 00:08:14,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I can't use this in actual battle…</i></b></font>

82
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I'm sorry, Choji.</i></b></font>

83
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:20,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I wanted to get this down</i>
<i>by the Chunin Exams, but…</i></b></font>

84
00:08:20,930 --> 00:08:21,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>It's okay.</i></b></font>

85
00:08:22,090 --> 00:08:23,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>The fact that you can even</i>
<i>do Sensory Perception</i></b></font>

86
00:08:23,930 --> 00:08:25,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>is amazing to me.</i></b></font>

87
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:28,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>You can't use it in real battle,</i>
<i>that's for sure.</i></b></font>

88
00:08:30,930 --> 00:08:31,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>However…</i></b></font>

89
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:33,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>It's these little tricks</i>
<i>you think you can't use</i></b></font>

90
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:36,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>that somehow work in</i>
<i>an unexpected surprise attack.</i></b></font>

91
00:08:49,970 --> 00:08:50,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Not yet...</b></font>

92
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:52,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…we can't let it end yet.</b></font>

93
00:08:53,130 --> 00:08:55,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Nah… Let's finish things up here.</b></font>

94
00:09:00,340 --> 00:09:01,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Choji, watch out!</b></font>

95
00:09:02,180 --> 00:09:04,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How do I watch out for
a foe I can't see?</b></font>

96
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,720
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Figure it out yourself!</b></font>

97
00:09:06,970 --> 00:09:08,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>In the direction of six o'clock!</b></font>

98
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>All right!</b></font>

99
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:24,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Thank you, Shikamaru!</b></font>

100
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:31,300
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Found them! The three of them
are on the move.</b></font>

101
00:09:31,380 --> 00:09:32,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I sense their chakra…</b></font>

102
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The enemy should be
heading this way.</b></font>

103
00:09:35,010 --> 00:09:37,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Since when do you
have sensory powers?</b></font>

104
00:09:38,430 --> 00:09:39,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's amazing!</b></font>

105
00:09:39,930 --> 00:09:43,050
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>"Right?!"
…is what I want to say,</b></font>

106
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:46,340
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>but in actual combat,
it's still difficult for me.</b></font>

107
00:09:46,930 --> 00:09:50,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If I have the time
to concentrate I can do it.</b></font>

108
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I see…</b></font>

109
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:55,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Well, no enemy will give us
the luxury of time…</b></font>

110
00:10:00,380 --> 00:10:02,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If there's no time to spare,
you just have to steal it!</b></font>

111
00:10:03,010 --> 00:10:04,300
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I pretended to be a pawn
to buy time</b></font>

112
00:10:04,380 --> 00:10:05,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and use Sensory Perception.</b></font>

113
00:10:07,180 --> 00:10:09,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Don't be so proud of yourself
for fooling us.</b></font>

114
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:12,180
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We thought he got you.</b></font>

115
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:13,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Now, now…</b></font>

116
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We're taking this.</b></font>

117
00:10:21,090 --> 00:10:24,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You can't buy time
for damage this small.</b></font>

118
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:30,130
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What? What the hell is going on?!</b></font>

119
00:10:41,220 --> 00:10:42,220
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I never expected</b></font>

120
00:10:42,300 --> 00:10:43,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>a Sensory Perception user
to be among you.</b></font>

121
00:10:46,340 --> 00:10:48,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>That counter attack was</i>
<i>perfectly executed…</i></b></font>

122
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:54,220
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I'm shocked it didn't work…</i></b></font>

123
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,510
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>But the speed with which</i>
<i>she undid the damage…</i></b></font>

124
00:10:58,930 --> 00:11:00,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I had kneaded chakra earlier</b></font>

125
00:11:00,970 --> 00:11:02,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>for this Medical Water Style
Water Jellyfish .</b></font>

126
00:11:03,550 --> 00:11:05,220
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If it weren't for
this self-healing...</b></font>

127
00:11:06,050 --> 00:11:07,720
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We would have been in trouble.</b></font>

128
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:16,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Kouji, Shishio…</b></font>

129
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:19,340
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm out of Water Jellyfish,
but can you still continue?</b></font>

130
00:11:20,300 --> 00:11:22,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sure… This time,
I won't allow any sensing!</b></font>

131
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:28,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Choji, Sakura!</b></font>

132
00:11:29,010 --> 00:11:30,050
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll track them with…</b></font>

133
00:11:32,430 --> 00:11:33,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Th-This is a sensory barrier?!</b></font>

134
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:38,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Blinding Sand Formation: Noise!</b></font>

135
00:11:38,470 --> 00:11:40,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I won't let you sense us anymore!</b></font>

136
00:11:43,630 --> 00:11:44,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ino!</b></font>

137
00:11:48,680 --> 00:11:50,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Be grateful to Ameno.</b></font>

138
00:11:50,970 --> 00:11:53,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>She gets really upset
if I do too much damage.</b></font>

139
00:12:12,510 --> 00:12:15,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What? What is it?
You're so antsy.</b></font>

140
00:12:16,260 --> 00:12:18,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Are you so worried about
your daughter's Chunin Exam?</b></font>

141
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:20,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I won't make any excuses, but…</b></font>

142
00:12:21,470 --> 00:12:22,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>my daughter's what you call</b></font>

143
00:12:22,630 --> 00:12:25,510
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>a jack-of-all-trades
and master of none.</b></font>

144
00:12:26,380 --> 00:12:27,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Before I knew it,</b></font>

145
00:12:27,470 --> 00:12:29,510
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>she turned her back on
training in our Secret Jutsu…</b></font>

146
00:12:29,590 --> 00:12:31,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and took up
Medical Ninjutsu training.</b></font>

147
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:35,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I mean… She's been such
a burden to you, Lady Tsunade…</b></font>

148
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:37,340
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Don't worry about it.</b></font>

149
00:12:37,800 --> 00:12:42,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Besides, I don't intend to
make her a Medical Ninja.</b></font>

150
00:12:43,260 --> 00:12:44,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Huh?</b></font>

151
00:12:44,880 --> 00:12:47,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I just thought it would come
in handy someday.</b></font>

152
00:12:48,260 --> 00:12:50,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Since she skipped out training
for the Secret Jutsu</b></font>

153
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:52,180
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>to come learn under me...</b></font>

154
00:12:56,180 --> 00:12:57,720
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>If I can't sense them,</i></b></font>

155
00:12:57,800 --> 00:12:59,130
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I can't get into</i>
<i>Mind Transfer mode.</i></b></font>

156
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:03,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>So I'll contact those two</i>
<i>with Mind Transmission...</i></b></font>

157
00:13:06,590 --> 00:13:08,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Sakura, Choji… Can you hear me?</i></b></font>

158
00:13:08,930 --> 00:13:10,300
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I-I hear you.</i></b></font>

159
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:13,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Ino! Can you do something</i>
<i>to sense the enemy?!</i></b></font>

160
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:15,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>My Sensory Perception</i>
<i>is being blocked.</i></b></font>

161
00:13:16,130 --> 00:13:18,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>But…I think the enemy's attack</i>
<i>follows a pattern.</i></b></font>

162
00:13:18,930 --> 00:13:20,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>That's pretty obvious!</i></b></font>

163
00:13:26,260 --> 00:13:28,220
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>The enemy attacks</i>
<i>from your blind side.</i></b></font>

164
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:32,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Like just now,</i>
<i>I can see Choji's opponent.</i></b></font>

165
00:13:32,630 --> 00:13:34,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Except, it's already too late</i>
<i>when I see one coming.</i></b></font>

166
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:36,720
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I knew it…</i></b></font>

167
00:13:47,970 --> 00:13:50,720
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>You can communicate with</i>
<i>several people at once.</i></b></font>

168
00:13:51,010 --> 00:13:52,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>This is</i>
<i>the Mind Transmission Jutsu.</i></b></font>

169
00:13:54,050 --> 00:13:56,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Transmission of intel is</i>
<i>a basic part of battle strategy.</i></b></font>

170
00:13:56,880 --> 00:13:58,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>As long as the enemy</i>
<i>doesn't find out,</i></b></font>

171
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:00,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>it's a huge military asset.</i></b></font>

172
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:03,720
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>You learned an awesome jutsu, Ino!</i></b></font>

173
00:14:03,880 --> 00:14:05,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I-I guess…</i></b></font>

174
00:14:07,430 --> 00:14:09,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>The more useful the jutsu,</i>
<i>the riskier it is.</i></b></font>

175
00:14:09,970 --> 00:14:11,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>That goes for the Mind</i>
<i>Transmission Jutsu as well.</i></b></font>

176
00:14:12,340 --> 00:14:14,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>If you misjudge your level of skill</i></b></font>

177
00:14:14,090 --> 00:14:16,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>and carelessly increase</i>
<i>the jutsu's intensity,</i></b></font>

178
00:14:16,340 --> 00:14:18,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>in the worst case you could die.</i></b></font>

179
00:14:20,340 --> 00:14:22,470
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>By increasing the intensity,</i>
<i>do you mean</i></b></font>

180
00:14:22,510 --> 00:14:25,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>widening the scope or increasing</i>
<i>the number of people involved?</i></b></font>

181
00:14:25,930 --> 00:14:28,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I guess that would change</i>
<i>how we strategize…</i></b></font>

182
00:14:29,430 --> 00:14:30,130
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Yes…</i></b></font>

183
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>There are levels within</i>
<i>the Mind Transmission Jutsu</i></b></font>

184
00:14:32,970 --> 00:14:34,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>that correlates to the user's skill.</i></b></font>

185
00:14:35,180 --> 00:14:36,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Transmission speed, the scope,</i></b></font>

186
00:14:37,010 --> 00:14:38,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>the number of people</i>
<i>in the conversation…</i></b></font>

187
00:14:38,430 --> 00:14:40,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>These change according</i>
<i>to the user's level.</i></b></font>

188
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:43,260
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>And when truly mastered,</i></b></font>

189
00:14:43,590 --> 00:14:46,630
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>you are able to transmit</i>
<i>what is most precious.</i></b></font>

190
00:14:48,180 --> 00:14:50,090
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>What is most precious?</i></b></font>

191
00:14:51,130 --> 00:14:52,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>The Mind Transmission Jutsu…</i></b></font>

192
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:56,130
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>In other words, using your body
<i>to communicate what is in someone's heart.</i></i></b></font>

193
00:14:56,970 --> 00:14:57,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>On the battlefield,</i></b></font>

194
00:14:57,970 --> 00:15:00,340
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>when you can feel the intensity of</i>
<i>your teammates thoughts for you…</i></b></font>

195
00:15:00,380 --> 00:15:01,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>that gives you more courage</i>
<i>than anything.</i></b></font>

196
00:15:04,010 --> 00:15:06,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I've only scratched</i>
<i>the surface of this jutsu…</i></b></font>

197
00:15:07,970 --> 00:15:10,220
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>If only I had spent</i>
<i>more time training…</i></b></font>

198
00:15:11,090 --> 00:15:14,470
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>If only I had spent the time</i>
<i>I used training in Medical Ninjutsu,</i></b></font>

199
00:15:14,510 --> 00:15:16,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>training with Dad…</i></b></font>

200
00:15:17,630 --> 00:15:20,050
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>That happens because</i>
<i>your chakra control is too rough.</i></b></font>

201
00:15:20,930 --> 00:15:24,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Control your chakra more delicately!</i></b></font>

202
00:15:25,590 --> 00:15:26,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Lady Tsunade…</b></font>

203
00:15:30,430 --> 00:15:32,050
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sakura, Choji, listen up!</b></font>

204
00:15:35,260 --> 00:15:36,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Huh?!</i></b></font>

205
00:15:36,050 --> 00:15:37,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>You can do that?!</i></b></font>

206
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:40,220
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It doesn't matter… I have to do it.</b></font>

207
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:43,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I have to raise my level
much, much more.</b></font>

208
00:15:44,430 --> 00:15:45,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Mind Transmission Jutsu!</b></font>

209
00:15:47,930 --> 00:15:50,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Send Sakura's thoughts to Choji!</b></font>

210
00:15:54,470 --> 00:15:55,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It worked!</b></font>

211
00:15:55,590 --> 00:15:57,340
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Send these thoughts to Choji.</b></font>

212
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:04,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I did it!</b></font>

213
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:09,300
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I saw something, but at this rate,
I won't make it in time.</b></font>

214
00:16:09,590 --> 00:16:11,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Transmitting takes too long.</b></font>

215
00:16:11,970 --> 00:16:14,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I have to send Sakura's thoughts
straight to Choji.</b></font>

216
00:16:18,930 --> 00:16:22,090
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I won't give up! More! More!</i></b></font>

217
00:16:22,300 --> 00:16:24,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I will raise the level of</i>
<i>my Mind Transmission!</i></b></font>

218
00:16:29,300 --> 00:16:31,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>More…more…</i></b></font>

219
00:16:32,550 --> 00:16:35,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>More…more!</i></b></font>

220
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:45,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>My thoughts this time!</i></b></font>

221
00:16:51,630 --> 00:16:53,220
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Cha…</b></font>

222
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:09,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How?</b></font>

223
00:17:14,010 --> 00:17:16,090
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How could you... Impossible!</b></font>

224
00:17:17,970 --> 00:17:20,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Intense feelings decided
the outcome of this fight.</b></font>

225
00:17:20,930 --> 00:17:22,720
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ino, are you still up to it?</b></font>

226
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:23,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Of course!</b></font>

227
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:27,720
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Then let's finish this.</b></font>

228
00:17:28,090 --> 00:17:28,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Right.</b></font>

229
00:17:28,930 --> 00:17:31,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>W-Wait!</b></font>

230
00:17:31,050 --> 00:17:32,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>– No excuses!
– No excuses!</b></font>

231
00:17:56,380 --> 00:17:58,090
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>All right, that should do it.</b></font>

232
00:17:58,510 --> 00:17:59,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We're in the middle of
the Chunin Exams</b></font>

233
00:17:59,930 --> 00:18:02,470
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and we're on opposite sides,
so thank you.</b></font>

234
00:18:02,930 --> 00:18:05,380
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm a Medical Kunoichi.
This is what we do.</b></font>

235
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:10,800
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Is it any wonder guys
love Medical Kunoichi?!</b></font>

236
00:18:10,800 --> 00:18:13,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Why are you saying
that nonsense again?!</b></font>

237
00:18:16,930 --> 00:18:17,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Moe, moe!</b></font>

238
00:18:24,630 --> 00:18:26,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Well, let's get going.</b></font>

239
00:18:28,130 --> 00:18:29,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But are you sure about this?</b></font>

240
00:18:30,260 --> 00:18:33,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yes. We have our scrolls.</b></font>

241
00:18:33,970 --> 00:18:35,550
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just the water itself is appreciated.</b></font>

242
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:37,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But…</b></font>

243
00:18:37,430 --> 00:18:39,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Talk about complete defeat…</b></font>

244
00:18:40,220 --> 00:18:43,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Well, we'll get both scrolls and
get our revenge in the Third Exam.</b></font>

245
00:18:45,470 --> 00:18:48,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yup. I don't consider this
a victory either.</b></font>

246
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:50,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So let's settle it next time we meet.</b></font>

247
00:18:52,470 --> 00:18:55,130
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The barrier you put up against
my Sensory Perception was really tough.</b></font>

248
00:18:55,590 --> 00:18:58,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No, we underestimated your skill.</b></font>

249
00:18:58,630 --> 00:18:59,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That was our downfall.</b></font>

250
00:18:59,970 --> 00:19:01,090
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He's right!</b></font>

251
00:19:01,130 --> 00:19:03,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>When did you learn
to do that anyway?!</b></font>

252
00:19:04,050 --> 00:19:06,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Huh? Well…</b></font>

253
00:19:09,380 --> 00:19:12,300
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What's the saying?
"He who knows, speaks least."</b></font>

254
00:19:12,840 --> 00:19:16,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I just wanted to prove that
I'm Lady Tsunade's apprentice too.</b></font>

255
00:19:16,970 --> 00:19:18,340
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Well said!</b></font>

256
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:21,130
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Anyway, we'll be going this way.</b></font>

257
00:19:21,550 --> 00:19:23,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And we'll go this way.</b></font>

258
00:19:30,630 --> 00:19:32,180
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>SENSORY PERCEPTION DIVISION</b></font>

259
00:19:32,430 --> 00:19:33,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Extreme delicacy is
required to perform</b></font>

260
00:19:33,970 --> 00:19:35,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>the Secret Ninjutsu of
the Yamanaka Clan.</b></font>

261
00:19:35,720 --> 00:19:38,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I have no doubt that the chakra control
skill required in Medical Ninjutsu</b></font>

262
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:40,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>will come in handy.</b></font>

263
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:42,760
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Lady Tsunade…!</b></font>

264
00:19:42,840 --> 00:19:48,130
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It may seem she's taking a detour,
but she's learning what she must.</b></font>

265
00:19:48,840 --> 00:19:53,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And you, as her father must
be well aware of that.</b></font>

266
00:19:56,630 --> 00:19:59,180
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>In time, you will surpass me…</i></b></font>

267
00:19:59,220 --> 00:20:01,130
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>In fact, I have faith that</i>
<i>you will become</i></b></font>

268
00:20:01,180 --> 00:20:03,510
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>the foremost shinobi</i>
<i>of the Yamanaka Clan!</i></b></font>

269
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:09,050
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Those guys were pretty formidable.</b></font>

270
00:20:09,090 --> 00:20:11,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Who knows what would have
happened if you weren't here Ino.</b></font>

271
00:20:12,180 --> 00:20:16,010
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Don't say that. You two bought
me time, that's why.</b></font>

272
00:20:17,380 --> 00:20:20,970
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If you two didn't give it your all,
who knows…?</b></font>

273
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:25,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I'm sorry, Dad, for skipping out</i>
<i>on my training.</i></b></font>

274
00:20:25,970 --> 00:20:27,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Please forgive me, Lady Tsunade…</i></b></font>

275
00:20:27,970 --> 00:20:30,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>For thinking that Medical Ninjutsu</i>
<i>was an easy way out.</i></b></font>

276
00:20:31,840 --> 00:20:37,340
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Your guidance and training</i>
<i>in Medical Ninjutsu helped me to grow.</i></b></font>

277
00:20:38,090 --> 00:20:41,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Calm decision-making,</i>
<i>delicate chakra control…</i></b></font>

278
00:20:42,510 --> 00:20:45,590
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Everything is pushing me in</i>
<i>the direction that I'm destined to go.</i></b></font>

279
00:20:45,930 --> 00:20:48,840
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>All right, let's do our best
and reach our goal!</b></font>

280
00:20:49,050 --> 00:20:49,880
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Okay.</b></font>

281
00:22:38,880 --> 00:22:41,460
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What? A doll? An enemy?

</b></font>

282
00:22:41,580 --> 00:22:43,790
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sakura! How are you doing physically?

</b></font>

283
00:22:43,890 --> 00:22:46,000
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You guys made it possible
for me to rest so I'm okay.

</b></font>

284
00:22:46,080 --> 00:22:48,500
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He's a puppet user!

</b></font>

285
00:22:48,590 --> 00:22:50,500
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ino, he's coming this way!

</b></font>

286
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:53,960
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If our enemy is a puppet user,
if we get the jutsu user then we'll...

</b></font>

287
00:22:54,210 --> 00:22:55,750
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sakura, use my body!

</b></font>

288
00:22:55,790 --> 00:22:57,000
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Leave it to me!

</b></font>

289
00:22:57,420 --> 00:23:00,420
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Next time on Naruto Shippuden:
"The Cursed Puppet"

</b></font>

290
00:23:01,300 --> 00:23:03,420
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This guy's dangerous!</b></font>

291
00:23:03,460 --> 00:23:04,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>IN NARUTO'S FOOTSTEPS ~
THE PATH TRAVELED
THE CURSED PUPPET


</b></font>

292
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:09,500
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Tune in again!


</b></font>

